      "When we are having a good day, we have the energy we need to spread kindness to the people around us. We can lend a smile or a helping hand and share our brightness with others. In return, when we are having a bad day, we can lean on those kindness spreaders for the extra help we need. Because if everyone shares a little extra kindness on their good days, we can all help each other get through our bad days."
